          explanation: 'Mollusca is a highly diverse phylum, including groups as different as snails and slugs (gastropods), clams and mussels (bivalves), and octopuses and squid (cephalopods), all sharing this basic soft-bodied, mantle-possessing body plan despite very different lifestyles.',
