          prompt: 'Define an ‘organ system’.',
          answer: 'An organ system is a group of organs that work together to carry out one or more major functions within the body, for example, the digestive system.',
          explanation: 'Different organ systems, such as the circulatory system, skeletal system and nervous system, work together to keep the whole organism alive and functioning.',
